# notification-service
# ---------------------
# This service is a LEAF node in the call chain — it doesn't call anyone
# else, so it needs NO environment variables to function.
#
# Nothing to inject here. This file exists just so it's obvious (and not
# an oversight) that there's genuinely nothing required.
#
# If you later add real notification delivery (SMTP, Twilio, etc.), THAT
# is where env vars like SMTP_HOST / TWILIO_API_KEY would go — out of
# scope for this project.
